      "translation": "返回引用游标。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Performs the actual scan command using the native client implementation. The given options are never\nnull.",
      "translation": "使用本地客户端实现执行实际的扫描命令。给定的选项永远不会为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
