    {
      "source": "Redis client agnostic <a href=\"Cursor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>Cursor</code></a> implementation continuously loading additional results from Redis server until\nreaching its starting point <code>zero</code>. <br/>\n<strong>Note:</strong> Please note that the <a href=\"ScanCursor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ScanCursor</code></a> has to be initialized (<a href=\"#open()\"><code>open()</code></a> prior to usage.\nAny failures during scanning will <a href=\"#close()\"><code>close</code></a> the cursor and release any associated resources such as\nconnections.",
      "translation": "Redis 客户端无关的<a href=\"Cursor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>Cursor</code></a>实现会持续从 Redis 服务器加载更多结果，直到达到其起始点<code>zero</code>。<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong>请注意，<a href=\"ScanCursor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core\"><code>ScanCursor</code></a>必须在使用前进行初始化（调用<a href=\"#open()\"><code>open()</code></a>）。扫描过程中发生的任何失败都会<a href=\"#close()\"><code>close</code></a>游标并释放相关资源，例如连接。",
      "count": 1
    },
